      "line": 44,
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [],
      "source_text": "For $h(x)=x^2-1$, safe means $|x|\\ge1$. With $\\dot x=u$, the chain rule gives $\\dot h=2xu$. A nominal input $-2$ projected onto $u\\ge-1$ becomes $-1$, the nearest allowed input. Review set-builder notation, the chain rule, and projection before the general formulas.",
